window.products.push({"id":662025,"name":"Handmade Tibetan Incense 80 Sticks (2 Boxes of 40 Sticks Each) By Men-Tsee-Khang","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HHG7CgqcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Handmade Tibetan Incense 40 Sticks By Men-Tsee-Khang   Two boxes with 40 sticks each for a total of 80 sticks.  Each stick measures 8.5 inches long.  The incense is hand prepared by (MEN-TSEE-KHANG) Tibetan medical institude in Dharamsala India.  It has great fragrance that you would absolutely love it.   Ingredients and composition: Carthamus tinctorius (41.01%), Rhododendron sp.(18.34%), Juniperus sp.(10.09%), Pisorhiza kurroa (9.17%), Rosa Satvus (9.17%), Dracocephalum tanguticum (1.83%), Artemisia sp. (0.915%, Santalum album (0.09%) etc.   Uses: Recommended for religious offering, meditation, protection against malevolent spirits and some communicable diseases. It can also be used as room freshner of for refreshing the senses. Especially it si recommended in the morning during meditation and prayers. Sorig Incense : In Tibet, the seed of traditionally using incense exists at an early age of human evolution. Buddhism flourished to a greatt extent in the 7th century under the reign of successive religious kings of Tibet, along with the preservation and development of making incense based on the secret tantric text by the great Indian Buddhist scholar Nagarjuna. Various formulas for making incense were developed by the great scholar of Tibetan medicine like Zurkhar Lodoe Gyalpo and Deumar in 14th and 17th century respectively. These were well preserved by the modern sholars like Ven. Dr. Kyenrab Norbu and in accordance with traditional formula this quality incense is prepared.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HHG7CgqcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GBBC","source_asin":"B00YJV32HE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-662025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YJV32HE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YJV32HE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
