window.products.push({"id":662171,"name":"Glass Oil Dispenser with Silicone Brush, 2 Pack 2 in 1 Olive Oil Bottle Dispenser Silicone Dropper Cooking Brush Oil Vinegar Measuring Container and B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61laUjG2UHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧹 2 in 1 Oil Dispenser with Silicone Brush: This set “kitchen helper” combined BBQ brush with oil dispenser, it can be used as oil dispenser and barbeque brush based on your needs. When it works as dispenser, just press brush head to suck oil out from 180ml oil bottle and squeeze brush head to drop oil out; If you brush food while squeeze brush head, it becomes a cooking brush which is heat resistant and can brush food evenly with 3-row brush head 🧹 Easy Use Oil Dispenser with Measurement Scales: This set oil dispenser is compact but convenient and powerful, just pinch brush head to suck and drop oil out, super easy; Wide bottle mouth makes it easy to pour oil without worrying about oil spills; Except that, measurement scales on brush head make you can observe quantity of oil you are adding while cooking. At last, oil-retrieve filter works effectively on avoiding oil dripping and reduce mess in the kitchen, your powerful “kitchen helper” 🧹 Multipurpose Oil Container: This set oil container not only can work as oil container, it also can be used to store other condiments like kinds of vinegar; At the same time, there are 2 choices in terms of color, red and coffee, specific color represents one condiment and it will make your cooking more convenient with less mess in the kitchen, your powerful “kitchen helper” 🧹 High Quality and Safe Oil Dispenser with Brush: Each oil bottle is built with high quality soda glass, durable and not easy to break when drop from kitchen countertop; The brush head is made from food-grade silicone which is heat and cold resistant, you can use it on pan and food directly when cooking, which is safe and healthy and no peculiar smell or deformation in use 🧹 Detachable and Easy to Clean: This set oil dispenser with brush can be disassembled easily, you can clean them separately and deeply, no needing extra cleaning tools, super convenient and easy","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61laUjG2UHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CIUOOAK","source_asin":"B09TW4P49X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-662171","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TW4P49X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TW4P49X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
