window.products.push({"id":662183,"name":"Chrysoprase Chips/Chunks (Tanzania) (Mostly 1-1/2\" - 2\") - 5pc. Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BBzA0l1QL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"These Chrysoprase Chips/Chunks come to us from Tanzania and it is very limited in quantity at this time. A member of the Quartz family, Chrysoprase is a rare form of Chalcedony, which often is found within deposits of nickel. This Chrysoprase is a light, mint green color (caused by the presence of nickel), with some brown and orange striping. A stone of grace and compassion, Chrysoprase facilitates deep meditation and relaxation. Use Chrysoprase to facilitate acceptance of oneself and of others. Working with the Heart Chakra, Chrysoprase is known for bringing hope into dire situations, and is excellent for breaking negative cycles. Chrysoprase opens and activates the Heart Chakra, allowing for a stronger flow of chi through this chakra. Carrying Chrysoprase Stones can be beneficial for those needing to release fear and bitterness. Chrysoprase can facilitate great leaps of inner growth, especially when used during meditation, and is helpful for those on the spiritual path. Chrysoprase can be a good friend during experiences of deep loss, by helping the one grieving to understand the necessity behind such experiences. Physically, Chrysoprase is good for ailments involving the heart, lungs, and liver. Primary Chakra: Heart Astrological Sign: Taurus Chemical Composition: SiO2 Silicon Dioxide w/Nickel * Pictures represent variation in color quality.  Please see product name for the actual quantity for this item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BBzA0l1QL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Healing Crystals","source_asin":"B00EK6HEZE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-662183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EK6HEZE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EK6HEZE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":662184,"name":"Blanket Storage Basket with Long Handles | Decorative Clothes Hamper Basket (Large)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1vHLnywDzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our hamper is the last hamper you will ever need! We can offer peace of mind when investing in a new cotton rope basket! We stand behind the quality of our baskets so if you have any questions or concerns message us! Buy our large Cotton Rope Basket!So many uses for your new Cotton Rope Basket! WHAT ALL CAN I USE IT FOR? Bathroom organizerStorage binsShoe organizersCloset organizersDorm room essentialsToy storage organizerClean or dirty clothesLaundry basket sorter Baby laundry basketNursery hamperLiving room decor Laundry room decorationsStuffed animal storage SOFT AND SAFE TOY BIN: Use this toy basket in a nursery as a soft and safe alternative to a toy box. The cotton woven rope material was chosen with babies and children in mind. Organize your kids playroom today with this stylish cute gender neutral storage bin. Toy overload? Get several baskets to organize toys in a nice and neat way that is easy for your kiddos to help during clean up time. This tote is huge and can be filled with numerous toys, books, shoes, games, or even use it for dog toys! Large Sturdy Handles Unlike similar baskets, our hampers are made with large strong handles. Our handles are easy to carry and stitched onto the basket separately and double enforced. As you can see this is very different than the competition who's handles are small and woven into the bin itself which will not hold up over time. Due to the unique design of our long handles, the baskets are easier to carry and hold much more weight than other totes. During a load test performed while in the manufacturing and design stage our tote was loaded with 15 lbs (twice your average laundry load weight) and hung by its handles for an hour. This test passed with flying colors. Our quality stitching and attention to detail during the inspection process is another quality that sets bins apart from th","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1vHLnywDzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Destination Dazzle","source_asin":"B08F27N55Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-662184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F27N55Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F27N55Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
