window.products.push({"id":662333,"name":"1968 Sinclair GTO at Gas Station LED Wall Clock, Retro/Vintage, Lighted, 14 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M819p0d9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"When was the last time you found a neon clock with a new design in it? I’m sure it’s been a long time. If you’re tired of the same boring neon clocks that have been around for the last 30 years, Collectable Sign and Clock has the clock for you! Our LED lighted clocks have the look and feel of vintage clocks from the 1950’s but all the modern technology from the 21st century. Passionate about classic Americana? So are we! Our clocks feature some of America’s most iconic advertising from the 40’s, 50’s, 60’s and 70’s! From oil and gas companies to vintage cars and trucks, we offer the best selection of America centric LED clocks anywhere! Proud of the US military? We certainly are! Our time-honored military and aircraft designs are realistic and inspiring! Aviation enthusiasts and pilots alike will appreciate the fine craftsmanship and artistic depictions of famous planes and jets from US military history. Put your pride on display with our beautifully designed wall clocks! Love the majestic beauty of nature? Select one of our wildlife-inspired clocks, which feature photographic images of deer, dogs, fish, bears and birds! Accent your indoor space with a stunning visual from the outdoors! No matter what style of classic Americana you’re looking for, Collectable Sign and Clock has a unique, beautiful and well-made clock for you. CLOCK SPECIFICATIONS: Best backlit LED clock on the market Best backlit LED clock on the market 14 inches across 14 inches across High quality, clear lexan outer protective lens High quality, clear lexan outer protective lens Plugs into any 110 outlet Plugs into any 110 outlet On / Off switch in cord On / Off switch in cord Quartz movement runs from AA battery Quartz movement runs from AA battery Perfect for the collector Perfect for the collector 1 year manufacturer warranty 1 year manufacturer warranty MADE IN THE USA MADE IN THE USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M819p0d9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Collectable Sign and Clock","source_asin":"B07NQV958C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-662333","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NQV958C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NQV958C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
