window.products.push({"id":662474,"name":"Induction Cooktop 36 Inch, Electric Cooktop 5 Burners, Drop-in Induction Cooker Ceramic Glass Induction Burner With Timer, Child Lock, 9 Heating Level","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-B6a-rgnS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Stylish Appearance, Drop-in Electric Stovetop】: The 36\" built-in electric cooktop could save space and fit perfectly with kitchen counter. With sensor touch control, durable scratch-resistant vitro ceramic glass, the glass cooktop not only looks beautiful, but also easy to clean. Please confirm if the electric cooktop is suitable before purchasing. The built-in induction cooktop size(LxWxH): 35.43'' x 20.47'' x 2.28''. Cut out size: 33.86'' x 19.29'', 220~240V, 38.75~40 Amp, 50/60Hz. 【9 Heat Level Settings & 99 Minutes Timer】: Our induction stove have 9 power levels to meet your different choice, which is convenient for you to choose the right power to cook a variety of different foods, perfect for braise, fry, simmer, steaming, boil, stir-frying, etc. Slider sensor touch control is easy to use for all family members. Sensitive Digital Control and up 99 minutes timer will help you cooking perfectly and accurately. Set power & timer and then enjoy leisure cooking time. 【Multiple Protection Functions】: This electric stove top apply with multiple safety devices, such as over-heating protection, residual heat indicator, child lock, and auto shutdown. Don't stress over spills with induction's easy-to-clean surface that generates heat only to your pan, not your cooktop, meaning spills can't burn onto the surface. Our electric cooktop is approval by ETL and FCC certification, you don't need to worry about security. Let’s enjoy cooking with sincreative cooktop. 【5 Boost Burners & Quick Cooking】: This portable cooktop is freely adjustable to suit your cooking needs. High-power induction cooker：2300 / 3000W（Diameter 11\"）+ 2 x 1800 / 2100W（Diameter 9.05\"）+ 2 x 1200 / 1500W（Diameter 6.88\"), rated power 9300W for faster heating up and quick cooking. Save your cooking time and makes it easy to handle multi-person parties. 【Wide Applications and Easy to Clean】: Smooth top style built-in electric cooktop 36 inch can work with stainless steel and cast-iron cookware, such as stainless steel, cast aluminum, cast iron, or enameled iron, which makes it a perfect cooking companion for you. The surface of the 36 inch electric cooktop is high-quality smooth glass, which can be easily cleaned with a damp cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-B6a-rgnS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sincreative","source_asin":"B0BCQ5R8VK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-662474","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCQ5R8VK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCQ5R8VK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
