window.products.push({"id":662577,"name":"Folding Wall Mounted Drop-Leaf Table Dining Table Space Saver Fold Convertible Desk White (Size : 12040cm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v7DkXB5CL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Specifications: Material:Wood-based panels Color: White Unique Structure: · designed with simple yet stylish appearance. We focus on products that fit in your space and fit on your budget. ·Mounting hardware included, installs easily. ·Space-saving design, creative, beautiful. Function： Provides a solution for small rooms, particularly kitchens, where limited floor space is available for a table, thus enabling maximum floor space to be maintained. Folds flat against the wall when not in use. Folds out quickly and easily when needed. Requires wall fixing. Before installation, ensure supporting wall is of appropriate construction and fixings included are suitable for your wall type. Nb Please be aware, simultaneous use of this item for laptops or notebooks and food and drink poses a risk to the user. Please contact us if you have any problems When your kitchen is narrow and the table is suitable for this purpose.With 2 connections, you can fold down the table after use and save space. Great for narrow kitchens, house corridors or small rooms. You can hang it in the kitchen, and use it as a dining area and additional storage space. Naturally, this folding table can also be used as a desk in a small children's room or in an office corner. Apply the laptop can be placed here prima. Care instructions: ·Wipe clean with clean damp cloth. Avoid using harsh chemicals. Pictures are for illustration purpose. All decor items are not included in this offer. Package Includes: 1x wall folding table","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v7DkXB5CL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CanvasLot","source_asin":"B07D1ZTS9T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-662577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D1ZTS9T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D1ZTS9T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":662578,"name":"ZEEYCH Shoe Display,(Pack of 3)Side Open Clear Plastic Storage Shoe Box for Display Shoes Sneakers or High Heels-Suitable for the Storage Of Cosmetics","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ux3gvlJ-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Transparent and visible】: The shoe display body is made of PP transparent plastic, and the shoe box door is made of PC transparent plastic. You can shoes display in 360 degrees. ZEEYCH shoe container suitable for most shoes within 12 feet, including fashionable high heels, high-top sports shoes, leather boots, etc. 【Durable&Sturdy】: Different from the traditional paper shoe display, it adopts sturdy PP plastic board as the shoe boxes body, and the joints are connected by buckles. After assembly, ZEEYCH shoe display is very firm, not easy to deform or break.The reinforced design of the box body allows the shoe box to withstand about 150 pounds. 【Stackable design】: ZEEYCH clear shoe display is equipped with connecting column.There are 4 holes on the top of each shoe box.The sneaker display can be locked and stacked with each other. After being locked, shoe organizers are very firm and not easy to loosen. Even if clear shoe boxes are tilted 45 degrees or lifted, they will not fall off, which is convenient for organization and storage. 【Magnet door design】: Each shoe display door is equipped with a handle for easy opening. There are small magnets on both sides of the shoe box door, so that the shoe display can be tightly closed. The shoe box is equipped with vents, and the inside of the shoe box is always kept clean and fresh, so that the shoes can be protected from odor, dirt, and dust. 【Guarantee】: PACK OF 3. Each shoes displaly has 7 components:the left and right side panels, the back panel, the lower panel, the upper panel with iron sheets, the sneaker display door panel, 7 connecting column, and 1 manual. The assembly steps are simple. If there are any problems or missing or damaged product components, please contact us immediately, and we will provide you with a satisfactory return and exchange service as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ux3gvlJ-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zeeych","source_asin":"B08ZSK7PX9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-662578","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZSK7PX9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZSK7PX9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":662579,"name":"Ozeri Professional Series Induction Fry Pan in Black Onyx, Made in Italy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+llXukUtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Exclusively made in the province of Brescia in northern Italy, Ozeri presents the Professional Series Induction Pan in Black Onyx, absolutely free of toxic substances such as APEO, GenX fluorinated chemicals, PFBS, PFOS, PFOA, and the lesser known NMP and NEP. According to the FDA, many of these chemicals constitute a worrisome class of nonstick compounds that have found their way into the food chain, including grocery store meats and seafood. Both the EPA and FDA have conducted research on exposure to some of these compounds that suggest associations with several kinds of cancers and health issues. Although the harmful PFOA and PFOS acids are being phased out of production, non-stick coatings today are often made with the aid of a new generation of fluoropolymers, known as GenX fluorinated chemicals and PFBS, which the EPA has more recently cited as suggestive of cancer and when consumed, may affect the kidneys, blood, immune system, liver and developing fetuses. Also of concern are APEO chemicals, which are restricted in Germany due to environmental concerns and toxicity in the food chain. By not using any of these ‘forever chemicals,’ the pan’s coating stands ahead of the curve, achieving the highest marks for food safety and environmental health. The Ozeri Induction Pan utilizes an inert coating that is also free of the lesser known but potentially harmful chemicals NMP (N-Methyl-2-pyrrolidone) and NEP (N-ethyl-2-pyrrolidone). With better non-stick properties, the Professional Induction Pan consistently renders cleaning a breeze. The Ozeri Professional Series Induction Pan in Black Onyx is exemplary in its Italian craftsmanship, kitchen appeal, and inductive technology. Durable and scratch-resistant, the pan boasts an aluminum core with a magnetized AISI 430 steel base plate for use with rapid heat-transfer induction stoves, allowing it to achieve cooking temperatures with less energy and time. Coating made in Germany. Pan made in Italy. Satisfaction guaranteed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+llXukUtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ozeri","source_asin":"B07VS2MKLC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-662579","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VS2MKLC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VS2MKLC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
