window.products.push({"id":662665,"name":"Gaming Chair High Back Computer Gaming Chair with Footrest, Ergonomic Game Chair PU Leather Racing Office Chair Adjustable Task Chair w/Headrest Armre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":67.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RE+KTxaaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you’re looking for a chair for your office, for your gaming room, for a child or whatever the occasion may be, have you considered aside from comfort, how safe the chair is? It’s not a well-kept secret that gaming for hours a day or sitting in a computer chair for hours a day isn’t healthy and can lead to long-term health risks down the road. This is why companies have decided to put more support and more cushioning in their chairs, otherwise known as lumbar and head support pillows. You may have seen these on some chairs or have seen pillows attached to the chairs. We present this brand new racing type high back office chair with a unique appearance and feel, unlike most office chairs on the market, with free USB electric massage, slight vibration can reduce the fatigue. If you don't want to use the massage function, you can roll up the data cable and put it in adjustable lumber support. And desk chair offers a stable five-point base with a gas spring, allowing the use to adjust for varying heights to better meet the needs of your office or computer desk. Feature 90 to 155 degree tilt mechanism. Larger-size seat cushion, wider chair back. Beautiful generous and strong practicability. Ergonomic adjustable headrest/backrest/lumbar support and footrest, armrest. Heavy duty five star chair base with 360° nylon castors for greater stability. WE PROMISE --If item was damaged during transportation, please contact us! we will sent replacement parts free of charge in few days. We guarantee you will love this ergonomic gaming chair. But if you’re not satisfied with this office chair, please get in touch with us. We have a well trained customers sevice team, which could reply you in short time and give you help, aim to give a better shopping experience to our customers. Please rest assured to buy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RE+KTxaaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TTY","source_asin":"B0BK6JLXTG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-662665","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK6JLXTG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK6JLXTG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
